0245304, 0.028300515958108008, 0.028300710022449493, 0.026781594031490386, 0.029208043939433992, 0.02862313308287412, 0.027465930907055736, 0.028686038102023304, 0.028352654888294637, 0.028652485110796988, 0.028839605976827443, 0.029041346977464855]], "latencies": [1.978801161982119, 14.574237490072846, 3.209120162995532, 3.459605825948529, 1.7340370760066435, 11.250396523042582, 0.2160204410320148, 0.4762222240678966, 1.2897665930213407, 5.9330337069695815, 1.5207203020108864, 6.7723606310319155, 0.7922460939735174, 4.720746619976126, 0.26256587100215256, 2.7231200060341507], "start_times": [780161.400879659, 780161.40098849, 780161.402167124, 780161.402215424, 780163.379894655, 780164.61156158, 780164.86203685, 780165.078463811, 780165.114158034, 780165.554896689, 780166.404151062, 780167.925343559, 780171.488220317, 780172.280891498, 780174.697907135, 780174.960913613], "queue_times": [0.00012728804722428322, 0.00022434291895478964, 0.0013970589498057961, 0.0014411240117624402, 1.9791149469092488, 3.2107782809762284, 3.4612498979549855, 3.6776739379856735, 3.713365438976325, 4.154101363033988, 5.003352676983923, 6.524541786056943, 10.087415445013903, 10.880083388998173, 13.297095905058086, 13.560099644004367], "generated_texts": ["Yes\u2014*Traction", "Below is a **complete, minimal, and ready\u2011to\u2011run** Rust application that\n\n1. Reads the current clipboard text (Windows, macOS, Linux).\n2. Sends that text to the ElevenLabs Text\u2011to\u2011Speech API.\n3. Streams the returned MP3/OGG audio straight to your speakers.\n\n> **TL;DR**  \n> ```bash\n> cargo new elevenlabs_clipboard_tts\n> cd elevenlabs_clipboard_tts\n> # copy the Cargo.toml and src/main.rs below\n> export ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=\"YOUR_API_KEY\"\n> cargo run\n> ```\n\n---\n\n## 1. Prerequisites\n\n| Item | How to get it |\n|------|---------------|\n| **ElevenLabs API key** | Sign up at <https://elevenlabs.io> \u2192 *API* \u2192 *API Key* |\n| **Voice ID** | In the ElevenLabs dashboard \u2192 *Voice Library* \u2192 click a voice \u2192 copy the `voice_id` |\n| **Rust toolchain** | <https://rustup.rs> (install `rustup`, then `rustup default stable`) |\n| **Audio output** | Any working audio device (the app uses the default output device). |\n\n> **Tip** \u2013 Store the API key in an environment variable so it never ends up in source control.\n\n```bash\n# macOS / Linux\nexport ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=\"sk-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\"\n\n# Windows PowerShell\n$env:ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=\"sk-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## 2. Project Layout\n\n```\nelevenlabs_clipboard_tts/\n\u251c\u2500 Cargo.toml\n\u2514\u2500 src/\n   \u2514\u2500 main.rs\n```\n\n---\n\n## 3. Cargo.toml\n\n```toml\n[package]\nname = \"elevenlabs_clipboard_tts\"\nversion = \"0.1.0\"\nedition = \"2021\"\n\n# Optional: enable the `clipboard` feature on Windows for better performance\n[features]\ndefault = [\"clipboard\"]\n\n[dependencies]\ntokio = { version = \"1\", features = [\"full\"] }\nreqwest = { version = \"0.12\", features = [\"json\", \"stream\"] }\n", "Sure thing! To make the \u201cFilters\u201d section clearer and easier to read, I\u2019ll need the current version of the document (or at least the part that contains the Filters). Once I have that, I can rewrite it in a more", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "## LCD\u2011Control System with a Potentiometer and a Temperature Sensor  \n*(Arduino\u2011based, using an LCD\u202fI\u00b2C backpack and either an LM35 or a DS18B20)*  \n\nBelow is a complete, step\u2011by\u2011step guide that covers:\n\n| Item | What it does | Typical pin\u2011out |\n|------|--------------|-----------------|\n| **Arduino** | MCU that reads the sensor, reads the potentiometer, drives the LCD | \u2013 |\n| **LM35** | Analog temperature sensor (10\u202fmV/\u00b0C) | VCC \u2192 5\u202fV, GND \u2192 GND, Vout \u2192 A0 |\n| **DS18B20** | Digital 1\u2011Wire temperature sensor | VCC \u2192 5\u202fV, GND \u2192 GND, DQ \u2192 D2 (with 4.7\u202fk\u03a9 pull\u2011up) |\n| **LCD\u202fI\u00b2C** | 16\u00d72 character display with I\u00b2C backpack | SDA \u2192 A4, SCL \u2192 A5 (on Uno) |\n| **Potentiometer (10\u202fk\u03a9)** | Adjusts a value", "", "### Quick answer\n\n```js\n", "", ""], "errors": ["", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", ""], "max_output_tokens_per_s": 108.0, "max_concurrent_requests": 8, "rtfx": 0.0, "spec_decode_acceptance_rate": 21.594457455113194, "spec_decode_acceptance_length": 2.5116120218579234, "spec_decode_num_drafts": 1464, "spec_decode_draft_tokens": 10248, "spec_decode_accepted_tokens": 2213, "spec_decode_per_position_acceptance_rates": [0.6659836065573771, 0.37363387978142076, 0.2062841530054645, 0.11543715846994536, 0.06898907103825136, 0.04849726775956284, 0.03278688524590164], "mean_ttft_ms": 145.87820770975668, "median_ttft_ms": 140.88598097441718, "std_ttft_ms": 32.100906153139015, "p50_ttft_ms": 140.88598097441718, "p90_ttft_ms": 179.0940395439975, "p99_ttft_ms": 214.2074689094443, "mean_tpot_ms": 14.503780001433531, "median_tpot_ms": 15.492762020222568, "std_tpot_ms": 3.4975966855183183, "p50_tpot_ms": 15.492762020222568, "p90_tpot_ms": 16.946608829297787, "p99_tpot_ms": 18.623333759219687, "mean_itl_ms": 40.01294358320473, "median_itl_ms": 38.45397854456678, "std_itl_ms": 12.42962110716379, "p50_itl_ms": 38.45397854456678, "p90_itl_ms": 40.85857857717201, "p99_itl_ms": 97.88004651083581, "mean_e2el_ms": 3807.0625455729896, "median_e2el_ms": 2350.960584008135, "std_e2el_ms": 3968.491558439808, "p50_e2el_ms": 2350.960584008135, "p90_e2el_ms": 9011.378577037249, "p99_e2el_ms": 14075.661345018305}